  <div class="security-main"><section class="security-panel"><div class="security-panel__intro"><span class="security-panel__number">01</span><div><h2>Sign-in protection</h2><p>Set how the platform responds to repeated unsuccessful sign-in attempts.</p></div></div><div class="security-panel__body"><div class="form-grid"><div class="form-group"><label for="max_login_attempts">Failed attempts allowed</label><div class="input-with-suffix"><input id="max_login_attempts" type="number" min="3" max="10" name="max_login_attempts" class="form-control" value="<?= esc(old('max_login_attempts', $settings['max_login_attempts'] ?? '5')) ?>"><span>attempts</span></div><small>Between 3 and 10 attempts before lockout.</small><?php if (!empty($errors['max_login_attempts'])): ?><small class="form-error"><?= esc($errors['max_login_attempts']) ?></small><?php endif; ?></div><div class="form-group"><label for="lockout_minutes">Lockout duration</label><div class="input-with-suffix"><input id="lockout_minutes" type="number" min="5" max="1440" name="lockout_minutes" class="form-control" value="<?= esc(old('lockout_minutes', $settings['lockout_minutes'] ?? '15')) ?>"><span>minutes</span></div><small>Between 5 minutes and 24 hours.</small><?php if (!empty($errors['lockout_minutes'])): ?><small class="form-error"><?= esc($errors['lockout_minutes']) ?></small><?php endif; ?></div></div><label class="setting-toggle"><span><strong>Alert administrators about failed logins</strong><small>Reserve this control for the notification integration when it is configured.</small></span><input type="checkbox" name="notify_failed_logins" value="1" <?= ($settings['notify_failed_logins'] ?? '1') === '1' ? 'checked' : '' ?>></label></div></section><section class="security-panel"><div class="security-panel__intro"><span class="security-panel__number">02</span><div><h2>Session policy</h2><p>Limit how long an authenticated browser session can remain active.</p></div></div><div class="security-panel__body"><div class="form-group"><label for="session_timeout_minutes">Session timeout</label><div class="input-with-suffix"><input id="session_timeout_minutes" type="number" min="15" max="1440" name="session_timeout_minutes" class="form-control" value="<?= esc(old('session_timeout_minutes', $settings['session_timeout_minutes'] ?? '120')) ?>"><span>minutes</span></div><small>Between 15 minutes and 24 hours. Session enforcement will apply to new sessions.</small><?php if (!empty($errors['session_timeout_minutes'])): ?><small class="form-error"><?= esc($errors['session_timeout_minutes']) ?></small><?php endif; ?></div></div></section></div>
